  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VeEQ2N0\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_56694573-3efa-443a-8633-442df914dc86.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"200\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/allthemods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_a3275c3a-969a-4088-a2c5-53d65a37be07.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/allthemods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_54901d94-6ad2-4408-869f-27ba9026b292.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AllTheMods/All-the-mods-10-Sky\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_b33feea2-9c55-4bae-9b5d-fff3e2ac52db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AllTheMods/All-the-mods-10-Sky/raw/refs/heads/main/presskit.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_c784751f-c531-4487-994e-5049e59f02d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>歡迎來到&nbsp;<strong>All the Mods 10：直衝雲霄</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">將 ATM10 與經典空島挑戰完美融合的終極之作！僅憑一棵樹、一個方塊，以及觸手可及的龐大模組宇宙，直面虛無，展開冒險。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>效能建議：</strong>為獲得最佳效能，請至少分配 <strong>6&ndash;8 GB 的記憶體（RAM）</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>多人遊戲支援：</strong>完全相容於伺服器與區域網路（LAN）遊玩。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>任務系統選配：</strong>可依照指引進行，或開創屬於自己的道路。<br><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:360px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LCvCpUhfL2A?si=3FpBxJL1qXK9pgST\" width=\"360\" height=\"216\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:360px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hh7aLmgwyMc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"360\" height=\"217\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TzgaPq6XY6k\" width=\"360\" height=\"202\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YvkYIdQNoJU\" width=\"360\" height=\"202\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>All the Mods 10</strong> 以其海量高品質且整合完善的模組庫聞名，如今更以全新面貌化身為空島模式！從微小起步，運用現代自動化、魔法、科技與探索，在虛無邊緣打造你的天空帝國。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_f0f52e24-87e6-4993-bd25-9abce9997875.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"731\" height=\"175\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特別感謝 Howester84 為本模組包設計了兩座最受喜愛的島嶼！他在 Discord 上分享了更多建築藍圖與精彩內容，歡迎前往<a href=\"https://discord.gg/r6V28h8grJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>給予支持與讚賞</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>此版本將 ATM10 強大的世界轉化為進度導向的空島挑戰，要求你發揮創意並高效自動化，以解鎖終局內容。<br><br>本次最大的變更在於我們已改用 <strong>NeoForge</strong>&nbsp;平台，且遊戲版本升級至&nbsp;<strong>1.21</strong>。隨著模組陸續推出，預料將會有許多更新！&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在 <strong>All the Mods 10 直衝雲霄</strong>&nbsp;中，我們將延續傳統，在加入大量新模組的同時追求更高的穩定性。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>「All the Mods」真的包含&nbsp;</strong><strong>全部</strong><strong>&nbsp;模組嗎？當然不是。</strong></span></p>",
